            {
                "entry_id": "8a8b7e3e-fad5-3564-9a7b-0614c8b84f6b",
                "word": "asking",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "47d55019-fae8-4e28-9a9a-e93d7e72e8d3",
                        "entry_id": "8a8b7e3e-fad5-3564-9a7b-0614c8b84f6b",
                        "tags": [
                            "comparative"
                        ],
                        "form": "more asking"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "59108b75-91d8-468a-89d3-118c90b2e731",
                        "entry_id": "8a8b7e3e-fad5-3564-9a7b-0614c8b84f6b",
                        "tags": [
                            "superlative"
                        ],
                        "form": "most asking"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3025e346-2851-35de-b53b-d269ffe12564",
                        "entry_id": "8a8b7e3e-fad5-3564-9a7b-0614c8b84f6b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "That asks; that expresses a question or request."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7ef44f9e-54d3-4487-bec1-520ee327ca13",
                                "sense_id": "3025e346-2851-35de-b53b-d269ffe12564",
                                "text": "He stepped to me while taking purchase on the handrail and looked through me with an asking look; finally he added with a sardonic smile. \"I know now that you feel; hatred coming from deep.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "293d69e6-8cfc-4acf-9660-8f699c28e344",
                                "sense_id": "3025e346-2851-35de-b53b-d269ffe12564",
                                "text": "It was as when some great gentle dog brings in a limp and bedraggled prize dug from the yard and, laying it at one’s feet, looks up at one with soft asking eyes."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "acd9ea95-1f15-4c7d-bc89-6854c4297d52",
                                "sense_id": "3025e346-2851-35de-b53b-d269ffe12564",
                                "text": "[…] all of them looked at each other in an asking way."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "1993ce04-a91a-37e8-b76b-ea8c7ab84ffa",
                "word": "asking",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "43d6f47d-3ab8-4453-94af-ae55d7024e01",
                        "entry_id": "1993ce04-a91a-37e8-b76b-ea8c7ab84ffa",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "askings"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5cb7cd92-906b-3ea4-a1a1-5ea3783a98b7",
                        "entry_id": "1993ce04-a91a-37e8-b76b-ea8c7ab84ffa",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The act or process of posing a question or making a request."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2304ce46-58b1-47cc-9737-fdd419329c26",
                                "sense_id": "5cb7cd92-906b-3ea4-a1a1-5ea3783a98b7",
                                "text": "His asking was greeted with silence."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ad28b3d3-d902-4fe0-86aa-ddf8045d9d2e",
                                "sense_id": "5cb7cd92-906b-3ea4-a1a1-5ea3783a98b7",
                                "text": "The large eyes sought his own, as if asking for help, and yet unable to do more than look their mute asking."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "88e19ceb-2f8b-4c01-856b-47c69fd7ecff",
                                "sense_id": "5cb7cd92-906b-3ea4-a1a1-5ea3783a98b7",
                                "text": "Form's silent asking, man's loving speech, the mute proclamation of the creature, are all gates leading into the presence of the Word."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0075af16-1565-429d-8229-da259fcbd297",
                                "sense_id": "5cb7cd92-906b-3ea4-a1a1-5ea3783a98b7",
                                "text": "If someone asks for love he will not get love, because the very asking makes him unlovely, ugly; the very fact of asking becomes the barrier."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0ac103af-34d4-305a-b980-decf4dfd3569",
                        "entry_id": "1993ce04-a91a-37e8-b76b-ea8c7ab84ffa",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A request, or petition."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "rare",
                            "singular",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4a823a1f-1a4c-4cb0-b1dd-d43c2d46c916",
                                "sense_id": "0ac103af-34d4-305a-b980-decf4dfd3569",
                                "text": "After many askings, pleadings, and episodes, all leading to nothing, she finally slumped down at the side of a well in a village where she was unknown."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "55a095fb-45d4-38f0-9341-af56c53fa384",
                        "entry_id": "1993ce04-a91a-37e8-b76b-ea8c7ab84ffa",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The marriage banns."
                        ],
